#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:295
msgid ""
"the spectrum is computed by cava in the plainspectrum-relay service;\n"
"the frequencies and the device are set in ~/.config/plainspectrum/relay.env"
msgstr ""
"le spectre est calculé par cava dans le service plainspectrum-relay ;\n"
"les fréquences et le périphérique se règlent dans ~/.config/plainspectrum/"
"relay.env"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:34
msgctxt "the player drawn inside the visualizer"
msgid "In the ring:"
msgstr "Dans l'anneau :"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:35
msgid "show the player in the centre of the ring"
msgstr "afficher le lecteur au centre de l'anneau"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:39
msgid ""
"The track, the position bar and the controls of the player widget,\n"
"drawn over the free disc inside the bars. On a line they go along\n"
"the edge the bars reach last. The ring keeps its size."
msgstr ""
"La piste, la barre de position et les commandes du widget lecteur,\n"
"dessinées sur le disque libre à l'intérieur des barres. Sur une ligne, "
"elles\n"
"longent le bord que les barres atteignent en dernier. L'anneau garde sa "
"taille."

